---
layout: page/layout
---
<section id="original" style="--box-bg-color: <%= page.blockBgColor %>;" class="fade-in-once">
  <section id="banner" class="box">
    <div class="left">
      <h1>Originals</h1>
      <!-- <h2>原創</h2> -->
    </div>
    <div class="right flex flex-col items-center">
      <div class="hover-box flex flex-col items-center gap-8 text-center w-fit px-4 xl:px-0" data-mobile-toggle="hover-box">
        <%- partial('_partial/svg/branch_top') %>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="context default flex items-center justify-center">
            <h6>
              They had names, and thus they had life.<br><br>
              Beneath the boundless stars, day and night become their doors, and rain and mist as windows.
              <br>They pass through first light, and through the withering of flowers and leaves.<br><br>
              Their souls turn into foam along the shore, settling as dust upon the ocean floor,<br>
              living on in poets’ songs, etched into the words exchanged between people.<br><br>
              <span>This is their world, their ocean</span>
            </h6>
          </div>

          <div class="context hover flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
            <h6>
              This page showcases my original stories.<br>
              Update statuses vary by work. Please refer to the list below.
            </h6>
            <div class="flex flex-row gap-4 mt-4">
              <h6 class="text-right">
                Restarting➤<br><br>
                Slow Updates➤
              </h6>
              <h6 class="text-left">
                Incessant Breeze, Final Oath<br><br>
                Jatorri, The Tales of Posidara, Sunrise After Rain, Endless Voice<br>
                Where the Bamboo Boat Drifts, Before you go<br>After the Candles Burn Low, A Place I Belong, On My Way to You<br>
              </h6>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <%- partial('_partial/svg/branch_bottom') %>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="link-area" class=" mt-10">
    <div class="novel p-8 w-full h-full box flex flex-row lg:flex-col">
      <div>
        <h4>中長篇</h4>
        <p class="py-4">
          指定具完整獨立世界觀，人物關係複雜<br>
          偶會有跨篇章的角色客串<br>
          主要人數5位↑ ｜ 篇幅粗估五萬↑<br>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 justify-center items-end mt-1 ms-auto lg:ms-0">
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/Jatorri') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('Jatorri') %> ➤</a>
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/Incessant_Breeze') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('Incessant_Breeze') %> ➤</a>
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/Final_Oath') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('Final_Oath') %> ➤</a>
        <a href="https://afterthelight.wixsite.com/ttop" class="pageBtn"><%= __('TTOP') %> ➤</a>
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/Sunrise_After_Rain') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('Sunrise_After_Rain') %> ➤</a>
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/Endless_Voice') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('Endless_Voice') %> ➤</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="short p-8 w-full h-full box flex flex-row lg:flex-col">
      <div>
        <h4>短篇</h4>
        <p class="py-4">
          部分故事與中長篇原創共用世界觀<br>
          可視為為獨立篇章，互不影響<br>
          主要人數5位↓ ｜ 篇幅粗估五萬↓
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 justify-center items-end mt-1 ms-auto lg:ms-0">
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/Where_the_Bamboo_Boat_Drifts') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('Where_the_Bamboo_Boat_Drifts') %> ➤</a>
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/Before_you_go') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('Before_you_go') %> ➤</a>
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/After_the_Candles_Burn_Low') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('After_the_Candles_Burn_Low') %> ➤</a>
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/A_Place_I_Belong') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('A_Place_I_Belong') %> ➤</a>
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/On_My_Way_to_You') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('On_My_Way_to_You') %> ➤</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="others p-8 w-full h-full box flex flex-row lg:flex-col">
      <div>
        <h4>其他</h4>
        <p class="py-4">
          此為雜項及全文章集中串<br>
          含括隨筆短詩，不屬於任何世界觀的短文<br>
          塗鴉、草圖，沒參成的企劃存稿
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 justify-center items-end mt-1 ms-auto lg:ms-0">
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/Original/Miscellanies') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('Miscellanies') %> ➤</a>
        <a href="<%= url_for('/' + page.lang + '/blog') %>" class="pageBtn"><%= __('blog') %> ➤</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>